#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide demonstrates a simple working example to get started with the "
"`qiskit-addon-sqd` package. In this example, you can use SQD to obtain an "
"approximation of the ground state of the $N_2$ molecule at equilibrium.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ipinapakita ng gabay na ito ang isang simpleng gumaganang halimbawa upang "
"makapagsimula sa `qiskit-addon-sqd` package. Sa halimbawang ito, maaari mong"
" gamitin ang SQD upang makakuha ng approximation ng ground state ng $N_2$ "
"molecule sa equilibrium.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To begin, recall that the generic interacting-electron Hamiltonian has the "
"form:\n"
msgstr ""
"Upang magsimula, alalahanin na ang generic na interacting-electron "
"Hamiltonian ay may anyo na:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$ \\hat{H} = \\sum_{\\substack{pr\\\\ \\sigma}}h_{pr} "
"\\hat{a}_{p\\sigma}^\\dagger \\hat{a}_{r\\sigma} + "
"\\sum_{\\substack{prqs\\\\ \\sigma\\tau}} "
"\\frac{1}{2}\\left(pr|qs\\right)\\hat{a}_{p\\sigma}^\\dagger "
"\\hat{a}_{q\\tau}^\\dagger \\hat{a}_{s\\tau}\\hat{a}_{r\\sigma} $$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$ \\hat{H} = \\sum_{\\substack{pr\\\\ \\sigma}}h_{pr} "
"\\hat{a}_{p\\sigma}^\\dagger \\hat{a}_{r\\sigma} + "
"\\sum_{\\substack{prqs\\\\ \\sigma\\tau}} "
"\\frac{1}{2}\\left(pr|qs\\right)\\hat{a}_{p\\sigma}^\\dagger "
"\\hat{a}_{q\\tau}^\\dagger \\hat{a}_{s\\tau}\\hat{a}_{r\\sigma} $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where $\\hat{a}_{p\\sigma}^\\dagger$ and $\\hat{a}_{p\\sigma}$ are the "
"Fermionic creation and annihilation operators associated with the $p$-th "
"orbital with spin $\\sigma$ and $h_{pr}$ and $\\left(pr|qs\\right)$ are the "
"one and two-body electronic integrals.\n"
msgstr ""
"kung saan ang $\\hat{a}_{p\\sigma}^\\dagger$ at $\\hat{a}_{p\\sigma}$ ay ang"
" mga Fermionic na creation at annihilation operator na nauugnay sa $p$-th "
"orbital na may spin $\\sigma$ at ang $h_{pr}$ at $\\left(pr|qs\\right)$ ay "
"ang one at two-body na electronic integral.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare molecule information {#prepare-molecule-information}"
msgstr "Paghahanda ng impormasyon ng molecule {#prepare-molecule-information}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To begin, specify the molecule and its properties using `pyscf` and the electronic integrals stored in `n2_fci.txt`.\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"This example ingests pre-generated data in a file called `n2_fci.txt`, which contains one- and two-body electronic integrals. To run the code cells below on a local machine, copy and paste the data into a file with the same name. This example also requires the `pyscf` package to be installed.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Upang magsimula, tukuyin ang molecule at ang mga katangian nito gamit ang `pyscf` at ang mga electronic integral na nakaimbak sa `n2_fci.txt`.\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Ang halimbawang ito ay gumagamit ng pre-generated na data sa isang file na tinatawag na `n2_fci.txt`, na naglalaman ng one- at two-body na electronic integral. Upang maipatakbo ang mga code cell sa ibaba sa isang lokal na makina, kopyahin at i-paste ang data sa isang file na may parehong pangalan. Ang halimbawang ito ay nangangailangan din na naka-install ang `pyscf` package.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
